": "toolu_01NgKDJLzm1jCmEeQSA52EYN", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53505, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01NgKDJLzm1jCmEeQSA52EYN", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 55087, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_011pqe2Qr1SG6MT7149AxrUg", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55387, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_011pqe2Qr1SG6MT7149AxrUg", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55387, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_011pqe2Qr1SG6MT7149AxrUg", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 59948, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all regions and is healthy again. I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 describing what happened.\n\n1. **Choosing the version:** The latest deploy, v2.3.1, was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an 18% error rate. The release before it, v2.3.1-rc, was also unhealthy. The most recent healthy release was v2.3.0.\n2. **Rollback:** The first rollback to v2.3.0 stopped partway because of an orchestrator error. Only us-east had changed, so regions were running different versions. I retried once and it finished. All three regions are now on v2.3.0, health checks are passing and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n3. **Incident:** INC-0001 (SEV2, checkout-api) covers the failing release, both rollback attempts and the current state. It lists two follow-ups: find what broke in v2.3.1, and find out why the orchestrator stopped the first rollback. The request to create it timed out, so I checked the incident list before retrying. The incident had already been created, so I didn't send it again, and on-call was paged only once.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Qh2tEqqRig51PLe1B1m968", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01ErvwhzLEt8gRkeNC8yuHDn", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Most recent healthy release is v2.3.0 (seq 1); later releases v2.3.1-rc (seq 2) and v2.3.1 (seq 3) are unhealthy.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_012dxayE1hLe7xfU5LW5iM4E", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01CeixjYt12ad2x7U43SCMG4", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Partial rollback: us-east is now on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Retrying the rollback once, since rolling back to the same version is safe to repeat.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01CdoSufPKwWsrKZjm3trpGK", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_012ZeStKFzaeWKfgtRenfGXY", "cal